# EMBED-01 session-owned uploads lane scope (issue #156, slice 3):
# external form sessions stage bytes into the form field's declared
# FILE-01 location and submit references to exactly what they staged.
# Server-minted paths plus the form_session_uploads ownership claim
# table (migration 0040 + ledger entry), pre-gate issuance/byte-PUT/
# finalize bound to the live startup session (revocation and capability
# drift kill outstanding finalizes with no grace), submit ownership
# check in the shared core (both external routes; operator path
# unchanged), traversal/revocation/stale/cap tests, and the slice-3
# capability-model ADR (numbering per #225). No new Cloudflare
# primitive (R2 FILES binding already earned); no CAPTCHA/Turnstile
# binding; no authenticated external-user access (owner cost decision);
# no app-embed or operator upload-path change; no client change.
